        "answer": {
          "short": "$7, 14, 21, 28, 35, 42, 49, 56, 63, 70$",
          "worked": "Multiply $7$ by each whole number from $1$ to $10$:\n$7, 14, 21, 28, 35, 42, 49, 56, 63, 70$.",
